{"id":"nea-careers","url":"https://www.eveonline.com/zh/eve-academy/careers","title":{"zh":"职业生涯"},"lang":"zh","source":"新伊甸学院（EVE Online 官方）","license":"© Fenris Creations（CCP Games），版权归原作者","blocks":[{"t":"quote","zh":"在群星中找到你的目标"},{"t":"h2","zh":"勇敢点，飞行员"},{"t":"p","zh":"无论你是在克隆飞行员国家大战中寻求荣耀，通过贸易和工业积累财富，为新伊甸的强大势力服务获取财富和声望，还是只是探索宇宙寻找宝藏和古老的秘密，你都可以自由开辟道路 – 无拘无束，不可阻挡，因为你将自己投入了星辰大海。"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/39SyXK1q7qjglmE78pTyhI/8a138e5ccef8ead50d9037485383a6d2/Aura-Square_630x550.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"无限选择 - 你将从哪里开始？"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/41vhdlZQ5Q8Ct9K7QaItza/e04bd88c72eda430eab4d5e74437e884/explorer-thumb.png?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"探险家"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/7KToHGNWQyWMltsBOYkiAR/a89e2e1c1521e6da9c2d5e1d4e584e94/industrialist-thumb.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"工业家"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/4Nl23v9ptGa51Lbg0kyqEw/f34d4dd1ee4a87986c8a1cf1a41df447/enforcer-thumb.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"执法者"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/31kK7l6haim8exFn1NWAQA/f65217d49ed7084a247ce6a5cca5eecb/sof-thumb.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"自由战士"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/jDGKkynmAceMhHttvuS83/313e6857bfd6350ffeca714d0531c199/eve-evolved.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h2","zh":"在星空会职业计划中取得成功"},{"t":"p","zh":"踏出星空会职业计划的第一步。有了其他玩家的支持和量身定制的训练内容，你会拥有新伊甸旅程中最好的开端。星空会职业计划会根据你选择的职业量身定制任务和目标，并为你的努力提供丰厚的回报。"},{"t":"h2","zh":"活动"},{"t":"p","zh":"无论你选择哪条道路，从安全的帝国地区到遥远的阿诺基斯和深渊空间，EVE 的各处都有各种各样的活动和职业等待着你。探索每一个选项，寻找你真正的使命。"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/5xgYBhKdrFUydXJVURzwQE/05fd1a0bafd2a2b8dcd4dc0a06ddca82/enforcer-web-bg.png?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h3","zh":"任务清道夫"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/7d4HEEVzkb9nhEZRtD231F/1307481f2dc20cd750796ab22cbddc10/space-game-pve-spaceships-station.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h3","zh":"赏金猎人"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/7HnfunPCAlZSpDHbndaPoD/a0e423a5fdb94e36b8b32f0b05bc6d50/eve-academy-explorer-featured-card.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h3","zh":"财宝猎人"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/18XAfv25qFyGcezGBtBu6w/22442f9f7e7f8d9acec85e5c3acc7a42/eve-academy-soldier-of-fortune.png?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h3","zh":"势力国民卫队"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/7HMGjLgW4uzWtrjhSOi7fc/e502612f6e87008b7a3482ee3cd965b8/Sandbox_Pirate2Screenshot.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h3","zh":"海盗"},{"t":"img","src":"https://images.ctfassets.net/7lhcm73ukv5p/28IfkRtV0X6Vj62lmuehYJ/a5c7606da757bee7cbaa590c60d9de09/Venture-Screenshot_3840x2160.jpg?w=1200&fm=webp&q=80","zh":""},{"t":"h3","zh":"打捞者"}]}